\p \v 61 \w The following|strong="H00428"\w* \w came up|strong="H05927"\w* \w from Tel-melah|strong="H08528"\w*, \w Tel-harsha|strong="H08521"\w*, \w Cherub|strong="H03743"\w*, \w Addon|strong="H00114"\w*,\f + \fr 7:61 \fqa Addon \ft is a variant of \fqa Addan\ft ; see Ezra 2:59.\f* \w and Immer|strong="H00564"\w*, \w but they could not|strong="H03808"\w* \w prove|strong="H05046"\w* \w that their families|strong="H01004"\w* \w were descended|strong="H02233"\w* \w from Israel|strong="H03478"\w*:
